oke,Aoku hiroi sekai no hate niComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi to kaeru beki basho ga aruComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku tachi wa eien niComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tooi mukashi sou kimeteitaComment: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みへの想｜お#｜もいが高｜た#｜か鳴｜!なってComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,限｜か#｜ぎりなきチカラ生｜うまれるComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,求｜も#｜とめるならば　どこまでもComment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,変｜かわらぬキズナ振｜ふりかざそうComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと本｜ほん気｜！きで心｜＜こ#｜こ#｜ろぶつけ슴｜あった喜｜＜よ#｜ろ#｜こびもComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,笑｜わ#｜らい転｜こ#｜ろげてナミダ乾｜か#｜わかした切｜せ#｜つなさもComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,繋｜つ#｜なぎあわせて風｜か#｜ぜの中｜な#｜か　あぁComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,はためいているよ　高｜た#｜かく　高｜た#｜かくComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　探｜さ#｜がすことを諦｜＜あ#｜き#｜らめたのComment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　独｜ひ#｜とり闘｜＜た#｜た#｜かい続｜つ#｜づけるのComment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,ねえ　どんな未｜み来｜！ら#｜い　覚｜か#｜く悟｜！ごしたのComment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢｜ゆ#｜めはもう手｜てにしたのComment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,目｜めを閉｜とじて耳｜み#｜みを澄｜すましてComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,探｜さ#｜がし出｜だそう　君｜き#｜みの答｜こ#｜たえをComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,道｜み#｜ちは必｜＜か#｜な#｜らず　続｜つ#｜づいているよComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ見｜みたことのない海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:16.59,Kanji - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,青｜あ#｜おく広｜ひ#｜ろい世｜せ界｜！か#｜いの果｜はてにComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと還｜か#｜えるべき場｜ば所｜！しょがあるComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くたちは永｜え#｜い遠｜！えんにComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠｜とおい昔｜＜む#｜か#｜し　そう決｜きめていたComment: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,My heart throbs at the thought of youComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:01:26.5