8,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.15,0:01:32.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.16,0:01:32.60,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:26.17,0:01:32.61,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:26.18,0:01:32.62,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.19,0:01:32.63,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.20,0:01:32.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:26.21,0:01:32.65,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.22,0:01:32.66,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:01:26.23,0:01:32.67,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.24,0:01:32.68,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.25,0:01:32.69,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.26,0:01:32.70,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:32.71,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.28,0:01:32.72,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.29,0:01:32.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.30,0:01:32.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.31,0:01:32.75,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:32.76,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.33,0:01:32.77,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:32.78,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:01:26.35,0:01:32.79,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:32.80,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.37,0:01:32.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.38,0:01:32.82,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:32.83,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.84,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:26.41,0:01:32.85,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:39.10,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outskirts of Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe came to help?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:46.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was surprised too.Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a relief. So Nami-san is okay...Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:58.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But now, we need to figure out how to meet up with them.Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Once they hear you're coming back, I'm sure they'll be happy.Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.70,0:02:12.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:14.32,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.53,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,we should never have done this!Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:21.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to face Nami-san...Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami and the others were so worried about you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:32.62,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, I put them through this terrifying ordeal...Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:39.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the rain is stopping.Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.65,0:02:55.07,Title,,0,0,0,,RookDialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:59.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I found it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You sure?! Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:12.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think they can hear us through this piece of glass?Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:19.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The last mirror piece I used to talk to you guys broke on the head of that tree monster, King Baum.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:23.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It broke!Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.56,0:03:27.39,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,There should be at least a piece of glass that connects to this one.Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...?Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:51.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer me if you're there!Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.26,0:04:09.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:11.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it is!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it! It's a piece of glass!Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:18.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is his voice coming out of a mirror?Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:25.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a long story, but Chopper and  the others are in a mirror dimension.Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:28.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Chopper?Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy! Thank goodness! You're really there!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Is Sanji-kun there, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's here!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san, I'm glad that you're okay.Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,How are you guys?Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We saved everybody from  inside the mirror, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:05:00.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook even got copies of the Poneglyphs!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:04.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.36,0:05:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Your compliment doesn't make me happy, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You silly little goose!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's good that Sanji's there, but did you two come to an agreement?Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.39,0:05:33.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji isn't... coming back yet.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:53.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:58.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash Big Mom's Tea Party and the wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:01.00,Main,,0,0,0,,And we're gonna save Sanji's family!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And then, Sanji will leave with us!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.56,Main,,0,0,0,,B... Big...Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! She's an Emperor!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want to risk everyone's... I mean, Nami-san's life over my own personal issues!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:31.70,Main,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:48.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:53.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard you and Luffy got into a big fight, so I was worried, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:58.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved! Really, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You big idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,If we do that, then Sanji-kun will leave with us, right, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.86,0:07:12.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san... I...Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,For scaring me like you did...Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami...Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:37.52,Main,,0,0,0,,But we can talk about that later. The Tea Party is soon.Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna help bring you back no matter what, Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:50.15,Thump,,0,0,0,,ThumpDialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,, What?! Are you proposing to me, Nami-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I think you're fine now.Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, Luffy, we know what we need to do now.Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:08:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Sanji's sister saved my life.Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So I wanna save them all.Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's save them all.Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.93,Main,,0,0,0,,But it will not be easy.Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:22.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though we're not aiming to take Big Mom down,Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,she always looks forward to her Tea Parties.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,By crashing it, we'll unleash the wrath of an Emperor.Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:43.12,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, while I'm sure you've faced a number of Big Mom's ministers,Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,they are merely the tip of the iceberg of her forces.Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:52.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The figures attending the Tea Party will be even more fearsome.Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:09:00.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Not to mention her invited guests from around the world, the Rulers of the Underworld.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.72,0:09:03.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We, on the other hand...Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Have ten people in total.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.99,0:09:14.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! We're not part of this!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:17.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't round up! There are only eight of you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:19.49,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope they slaughter you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I've already told everyone here,Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,but I need to tell you about something else.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of Capone "Gang" Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:38.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's the guy who took Sanji away.Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:45.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He's one of the Worst Generation, with a name as infamous as yours.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:50.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He hails from the West Blue, where there are five powerful Mafia familes.Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,They control the underworld.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They are known as the Five Families of the West, and one of those bosses,Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:01.04,Main,,0,0,0,,is "Gang" Bege.Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,He was given his "Gang" epithet when he was young. He used to be a notorious hitman.Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,A hitman...Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard he was a sick young man who cut the heads off helpless creatures...Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,and took joy watching them in the throes of death.Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of awful person would...?Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Now imagine that happening to an organization.Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.76,Main,,0,0,0,,How does it taste?Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish it were more bitter.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, how about this?Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:45.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,You little...Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The lead tastes bitter, doesn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,In his days as a young gangster, he killed the leaders of criminal organizations.Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.47,0:11:09.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And when he became the leader of his own family, he continued to only kill his rivals.Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:13.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:16.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't resist.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Are you betraying me?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You're outnumbered!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But Bege...Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,never showed interest in his enemy's position or territory.Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,He merely took their valuables and left.Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.80,Captions,,0,0,0,,BLOODY TRAGEDY! AN INTERNAL FEUD?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.26,Captions,,0,0,0,,WAKING NIGHTMARE! UNDERWORLD REMAINS TENSEDialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:43.72,Captions,,0,0,0,,THE UNDERWORLD SOCIETY IN CHAOS! TRIGGERED BY THE ASSASSINATION?Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, he would enjoy watching  the violent power struggles within the groupsDialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:56.57,Main,,0,0,0,,and the confusion of their allied syndicates.Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:11:59.86,Main,,0,0,0,,He is truly a tasteless man.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.86,0:12:03.99,Main,,0,0,0,,But in this world, what goes around comes around.Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:09.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He is now targeted constantly by those seeking vengeance.Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:14.63,Main,,0,0,0,,However,Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:21.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege treats that like a game. He uses his iron fortres to fight them off,Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,and mocks the weakness of his enemies.Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:29.18,Main,,0,0,0,,When he got tired of being on land, he went out to sea and continued to do the same things.Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did this?! Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:41.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He's made his name by taking out pirates captains. Only the pirate captains.Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.28,0:12:51.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Even at sea, he is plagued by enemies seeking revenge...Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:56.60,Main,,0,0,0,,So, working for an Emperor is his perfect safe haven.Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why he decided to ally with Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:07.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Because Big Mom thought highly of his sharpened sense of vigilance and incredible defensive ability,Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:12.49,Main,,0,0,0,,he was granted the title of "Rook" just before the upcoming Tea Party,Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,and placed in charge of security for the entire event.Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:20.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling us this now, Jinbe?Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:26.11,Main,,0,0,0,,If they are the security guards, nobody can stop them from achieving their goal.Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:26.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:31.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The main event of this Tea Party is the wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,As you are now aware, Big Mom intends to slaughter the Vinsmokes during the ceremony,Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and then acquire the remnants of Germa for herself.Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:46.43,Main,,0,0,0,,But meanwhile, behind her back,  Bege has his own plan to take Big Mom's head.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:47.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.59,0:13:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?! Everyone is planning their own conspiracies!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.35,0:13:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm sure you remember that Pekoms was the one who guided you here.Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He was kidnapped by Bege,Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,and they tried to get him to cooperate with their plan.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:10.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms... So that's where he went...Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Pekoms is loyal, so he refused. In order to keep him quiet, Bege shot him off a cliff into a swarm of sharks.Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:30.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:38.27,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,my companions were watching, and saved him just in time.Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,He's currently recuperating.Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:49.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! He's okay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:52.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been through a lot.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn that Bege guy! I'll make him pay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, this is what I wanted to discuss with you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.38,0:15:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I came up with a plan  after I learned everything from Pekoms.Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:13.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I tried to predict your actions.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I figured that if you learned the truth,Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:21.15,Main,,0,0,0,,you would decide to rescue Sanji and his family.Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:27.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's not fair to Pekoms, but considering the circumstances...Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:30.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Should we really make an enemy of Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:37.70,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tea Party begins at 10 A.M.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's about five hours from now.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The ten of us need to come up with a plan in that timeframe.Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:46.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop counting us as a part of this!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn brutes! I'll let them know what you're up to!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:56.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy, Bege and his crew have been  relentlessly preparing for this day.Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's ally with Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.06,0:16:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:14.32,Main,,0,0,0,,But... you're probably right.Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:15.91,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you insane, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:21.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy wants to do this?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You see? I told you he would want to!Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, four of our six here are against this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:30.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you care about Bege-san's ill deeds?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, this way, everything'll work out, right?Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:35.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't make a decision like that...Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:40.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, I arranged a meeting earlier. Do you want to go meet them?Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go right now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. If something doesn't feel right, you can refuse!Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a different goal, after all.Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Sanji. Bege and his crew's base  is on the northwest side of the island.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,The eight of us will head there first from this dimension. See you there!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop counting us as part of your group!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:16.93,Captions,,0,0,0,,Fire Tank Pirates' Base,  Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you get rid of Bobbin?Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,Fire Tank PiratesDialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, he was chasing Black Leg.Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:30.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you, Germa are my heroes.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.32,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Monster Gun" VitoDialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:36.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they really coming here?Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:38.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Father?Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:40.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Hitman" GottiDialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe isn't the type of man to joke around.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we're both opposing Big Mom,Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:54.01,Main,,0,0,0,,we shouldn't make extra enemies - he's right about that.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Everything after that depends on what Straw Hat says.Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't work out...Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:04.10,Main,,0,0,0,,we'll just kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:15.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,The Cooks Are Busy Preparing  the Wedding Cake...Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:15.36,Captions,,0,0,0,,Great Kitchen, 8th Floor,  Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:32.35,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Soft and fluffy... ♪ –  ♪ Moist and fluffy... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Life ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.34,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ There's no such thing ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A life of torment, the taste of tears ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:42.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,Streusen - "Gourmet Knight" Head Chef, Big Mom PiratesDialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:43.85,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A pinch of salt ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Tears of mortification ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:49.27,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ A tablespoonful ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:54.15,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ If that's how it is at least for your dessert ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:19:04.03,Main,,0,0,0,,♪ Don't you want some sweet cake? ♪Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:04.03,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Head chef! Head chef!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Soft and fluffy... ♪ –  ♪ Moist and fluffy... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Soft and fluffy... ♪ –  ♪ Moist and fluffy... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Soft and fluffy... ♪ –  ♪ Moist and fluffy... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:20.45,Main,,0,0,0,,– ♪ Soft and fluffy... ♪ –  ♪ Moist and fluffy... ♪Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.26,0:19:30.77,Captions,,0,0,0,,Eastern InletDialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:30.77,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Pekoms! You need to rest!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:40.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Grr! Did Jinbe really tell Mama about that rat, Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,By now, I'm guessing that Bege has been beaten to death by Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Grr! You guess?! Your guess isn't enough! I gotta make sure to tell her...Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa.Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:20:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to keep resting, Pekoms.Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.88,0:20:07.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Praline, in case they stop him from telling her... Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.18,0:20:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're concerned about that, then leaving it to Jinbe is the best option!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:15.31,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be beaten again in your current condition.  Just keep quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:19.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right, Pekoms! As a ship's doctor, I won't allow you to go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.81,0:20:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't move a muscle!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right! He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.87,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah. – Rest! Rest!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys are acting weird.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Gulp!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:42.39,Main,,0,0,0,,There was something going on last night in the inlet.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:46.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw some people carrying things around!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:47.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Gulp!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:53.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I appreciate that you saved me, but I need to leave!Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, we can't allow that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:58.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you can't? Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you guys hiding?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Gulp!!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:19.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Fire Tank Pirates' BaseDialogue: 0,0:21:16.78,0:21:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is Bege's base!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.45,0:21:33.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of guy is Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You heard what Jinbe said.Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:38.94,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You coward!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Think of him as a scheming and brutal mafia boss.Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:58.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,4 Hours and 15 Minutes  Until the Tea PartyDialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:06.45,Main,,0,0,0,,My hero! Vinsmoke Sanji of Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:11.06,CaptionsBig,,300,0,310,,"Monster Gun"Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:09.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to see you again-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's you...Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's everyone else? Are you Bege?Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:18.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be in such a rush. They are here or rero.Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:20.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "rero"?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.65,0:22:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:29.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You made me worried, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.80,0:22:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for that... Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.84,0:22:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That aside, why are you dressed like this?Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:40.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys go take a bath too?Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.33,0:22:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you so relaxed?! We don't have time! And you don't even like baths!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you two must take one, too-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:52.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll talk afterwards-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,A bath right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:58.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Father won't meet with anyone who is dirty.Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:23:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's dirty?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:15.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,Women's Bath,  Bege's BaseDialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:25.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Lola was turned  into a warthog zombie?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,And she was chasing around a guy she fell in love with!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:32.14,Main,,0,0,0,,That definitely sounds like Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:35.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Back then... and now once again in those scary woods,Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.50,0:23:39.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what would've happened to me if it weren't for Lola.Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.02,0:23:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! But you guys saved my sister, too! Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.75,0:23:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm crying tears of joy.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.36,0:23:50.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been close our entire lives.Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.82,0:23:53.37,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Since we're twins!Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.37,0:23:58.66,Main,,0,0,0,,A zombie! I can't imagine a dead person moving. The sea is like a wonderland!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:02.37,Main,,0,0,0,,So, was Lola turned back into a human?Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm sure she's still doing well as a pirate.Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.34,0:24:14.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she found someone to marry...Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom sounded so mad when she talked about Lola running away from a marriage.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.15,0:24:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... that was a big deal.Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.90,0:24:30.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.41,0:24:35.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is reviled by all Giants in the world for a reason.Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.99,0:24:39.20,Main,,0,0,0,,All of the Giants in the world?Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:43.80,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why even though Totto Land has a diverse population,Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:46.67,Main,,0,0,0,,there are no Giants.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:49.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Giants really exist!Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:51.40,Main,,0,0,0,,One day,Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.70,0:24:54.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola had a surprise suitor...Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,who claimed it was love at first sight.Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:04.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It was none other than Prince Loki of Elbaf,  the land of the Giants!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,A prince?! Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama practically cried with joy.Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.11,0:25:13.99,Main,,0,0,0,,She thought if Lola became the princess of Elbaf,Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.99,0:25:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,her long-standing feud with the Giants would be resolved,Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.61,0:25:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,and she'd even gain access to the army of Elbaf, the country known as the mightiest in the whole world.Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.58,0:25:26.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.54,0:25:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's what she ran away from.Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.46,0:25:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It all went downhill from there.Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.43,0:25:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,She tried to use me as a substitute,Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:41.19,Main,,0,0,0,,but he noticed that I wasn't Lola.Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.10,0:25:46.23,Main,,0,0,0,,So her relationship with the Giants got even worse.Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:52.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, she gave up the idea of becoming friendly with actual Giants,Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.78,0:25:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,and started investing in research to gigantify regular humans instead.Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:26:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Her anger towards Lola only worsened, and she was branded a criminal in this country!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.96,0:26:06.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If she ever comes back, she'll be killed!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.92,0:26:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, she couldn't stand looking at me anymore, since I look just like Lola.Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.30,0:26:17.51,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Get that damn face out of my sight!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.00,0:26:23.89,Main,,0,0,0,,When she saw me, she hit me without mercy. For years, I always had fresh wounds.Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.93,0:26:28.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that my own mother would kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't see that monster as my mother anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.45,0:26:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,However, Lola is very carefree... She probably has no idea that her mother wants to kill her.Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.41,0:26:51.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I see... Everything makes sense now.Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.92,0:26:58.55,Main,,0,0,0,,So when Bege said he was going to assassinate Mama, I felt nothing at all.Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.09,0:27:02.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You might think I'm terrible, but it's the truth.Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.01,0:27:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, well, that bath felt so good!Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.89,0:27:11.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, just like heaven!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.47,0:27:13.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I refuse to  move on to the next life!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.77,0:27:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This feels like the aftermath of a battle... I'm getting too relaxed. It hasn't even started yet!Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.99,0:27:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, Luffy-san.Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.12,0:27:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,There's milk in here. Milk!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.50,0:27:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go through our fridge without asking!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.13,0:27:37.59,Main,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I needed. I lost my tooth.Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,And my face has been cracked.Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.22,0:27:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the milk!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.53,0:28:00.70,Main,,0,0,0,,All better!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.70,0:28:03.27,Main,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.27,0:28:06.58,Captions,,0,0,0,,3 Hours and 30 Minutes  Until The Tea PartyDialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you, Chiffon! I can't believe you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.91,0:28:10.78,Main,,0,0,0,,How can you help someone who wants to kill Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.08,0:28:18.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon-sama, please think about this! You know no one could ever kill Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You know what she's done to me, right?Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.47,0:28:29.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Lola. Bege and Pez are my only family now!Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.52,0:28:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need anyone else!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.74,0:28:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay, it's okay.Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.36,0:28:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone's gathered, right?Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.57,0:28:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you cleaned yourselves up a bit?Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.49,0:28:52.87,Main,,0,0,0,,As the saying goes, "The suit makes the man."Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.87,0:28:57.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't talk to anyone that doesn't take care of their appearance.Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.75,0:29:05.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So, we've got three and a half hours to go.Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.72,0:29:07.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's first decide...Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.64,0:29:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,If we're working together or not.Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.07,0:29:33.62,Main,,0,0,0,,They're good, aren't they, Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.62,0:29:36.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys restrain yourselves?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.17,0:29:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What? These are for us to eat, right?Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,From our perspective, you guys are just a nuisance.Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.39,0:29:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The easiest solution would be for us to kill all of you, here and now.Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.02,0:29:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.64,0:29:59.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If I die, you won't have your chance to kill Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.30,0:30:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the ceremony would be cancelled.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.58,0:30:06.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm not back two hours before the wedding, they'll be suspicious.Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.86,0:30:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I hate to admit it, but you're right.Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.63,0:30:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll keep you alive, in that case.Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to waste on threats.Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.67,0:30:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, how are you feeling about this? Can you work with them?Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:26.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think?Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.99,0:30:48.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You're Caesar, aren't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.36,0:30:52.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Caesar?! Where?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.69,0:30:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,He's been here the whole time...Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:56.25,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you not notice...?Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.67,0:31:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,This research is so pointless! I'm not gonna work anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.93,0:31:16.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and do as you like with me, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.70,0:31:21.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Caesar Clown!Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.10,0:31:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm working my butt off! Tell that to Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.28,0:31:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need.Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.94,0:31:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.16,0:31:39.91,Main,,0,0,0,,When I asked them to let me watch over you, they agreed without a question.Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.91,0:31:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm now a trusted Rook!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.15,0:31:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that my heart?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.25,0:31:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to let you go. If you help me in return, that is...Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:32:00.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Do you have any idea who you're talking to?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.49,0:32:05.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the genius scientist Caesar Clown!  I could destroy the world if I wanted to!Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.03,0:32:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I know who you are.Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.04,0:32:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I came here.Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.84,0:32:20.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I served Big Mom and now Bege!Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.33,0:32:26.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta work anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:28.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you doing your job-rero?Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.34,0:32:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I am! Who do you think I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.59,0:32:35.26,Main,,0,0,0,,This is much more to my liking than what she had me do!Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.26,0:32:40.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The greatest piece of art will soon be completed!Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good to know.Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.48,0:32:48.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Crew will be here shortly-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.48,0:32:51.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! The Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.53,0:32:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! I never wanna see those guys again!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.24,0:32:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,When they're around, everything goes wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.41,0:33:05.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Father wants you to attend the meeting too-rero.Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.47,0:33:07.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be late.Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.17,0:33:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice!Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.39,0:33:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Caesar? No, I am Bege's blood brother...Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:30.53,Main,,0,0,0,,"Gangster" Gastino!Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.65,0:33:33.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Gangster"  GastinoDialogue: 0,0:33:34.98,0:33:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,– He's not even attempting to hide it... – "Gastino"?Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.36,0:33:40.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Because he's a gas human?Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.74,0:33:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He's even laughing the same way.Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.04,0:33:46.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.  I thought you were someone else. Sorry about that.Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.07,0:33:49.36,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you were right! He's obviously Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.17,0:33:53.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it is you! What are you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.75,0:33:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'd be here if I had a choice, you idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.05,0:34:00.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Because of you guys, I was handed over to Big MomDialogue: 0,0:34:00.68,0:34:05.43,Main,,0,0,0,,and my only escape from certain death was  this guy taking my heart and making me his slave!Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.43,0:34:06.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm being pushed around!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.87,0:34:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,If you see Trafalgar Law, tell him I'll kill him when I see him again!Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You too, if I get the chance!Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.19,0:34:17.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! This is so pointless.Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.33,0:34:26.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:28.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.55,0:34:31.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to work with me or not?Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all, let me punch you for shooting Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.69,0:34:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I go!Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.05,0:34:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.82,0:34:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.45,0:35:06.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Pull back your fist, Luffy! We won't come to an agreement this way!Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.29,0:35:08.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But he shot my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.00,0:35:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyone talking bad about Father is unforgivable!Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.10,0:35:14.92,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Gotti! Calm down-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.92,0:35:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.05,0:35:17.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Let him do it.Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.59,0:35:21.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Kick these bastards out!Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:23.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You back off!Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.28,0:35:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.02,0:35:30.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen...Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.90,0:35:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it can't be helped...Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.13,0:35:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you like Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.92,0:35:39.40,Main,,0,0,0,,– No way! – No way!Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:42.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you're on the same side.Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.54,0:35:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't share the same lifestyle or goals, you have a common enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:52.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You can kill each other later,Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,but if you join hands now, it'll be in everyone's favor!Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.42,0:36:00.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So what's the plan?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.87,0:36:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I've planned the whole thing in exacting detail.Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:07.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just do it! Then, I'll be through with you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.68,0:36:10.80,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Lance  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll